  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.31\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.31 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.30\n- Updated to depend on FireForNet.Firebase.Firestore 1.0.1-preview.30, which fixes offline ServerAndCache reads so they fall back to the cache, maps gRPC call-creation failures to FirestoreErrorCode.Unavailable, makes cached timestamp filters match server-cached Timestamp values at Firestore native precision, and fixes Timestamp.FromDateTime/FromDateTimeOffset throwing for pre-1970 instants. Persisted field indexes from earlier previews are rebuilt automatically on open; no manual migration is required. BREAKING: the parameterless WithConverter<TModel>() is removed; use Collection<T>()/Document<T>() for JSON auto-conversion or WithConverter with a converter/delegates. Custom model conversion now runs through internal document codecs on native references and queries (the Converted* wrapper hierarchy is retired), and IDocumentSnapshot<T>.TryGet(field, out value) distinguishes an absent field from a stored null.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.29\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.29 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.28\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.28 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.27\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.27 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.26\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.26 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.25\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.25 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.24\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.24 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.23\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.23 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.22\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.22 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.21\n- No functional changes; synchronized with the framework-free MAUI integration sweep.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.20\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.20 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.19\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.19 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.18\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.18 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.17\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.17 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.16\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.16 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.15\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.15 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.14\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.14 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.13\n- Updated to depend on FireForNet.Firebase.Firestore 1.0.1-preview.13, which adds offline-first optimistic writes (opt-in via FirestoreBuilder.OptimisticWrites) and eliminates the proto-to-JSON round-trip on typed model conversion. Offline writes persist via the SQLite backend.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.12\n- Updated to depend on FireForNet.Firebase.Firestore 1.0.1-preview.12, which fixes ObjectDisposedException on SemaphoreSlim.Release() during network disable and UnobservedTaskException from WebChannel receive-loop exceptions during concurrent disposal.",
